            </note>
            <note corresp="#d99-f2" n="2" xml:id="d99-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 93545 to New Delhi, April 12, reported that the story appeared in the
                    April 1978 edition of <hi rendition="#italic">Outside</hi> magazine and on the
                    April 12 broadcast of the <hi rendition="#italic">Today</hi> show. (National
                    Archives, RG 59, Central Foreign Policy File,
                    D780157–1085)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
